yes,

you can say the scaling parameter in a copy to be eq to another one, so

f(sz, copy="se", replicate=sz.repl, fixed=FALSE , hyper=hypercopy)+

f(sz0, copy=“se0”, fixed=FALSE, hyper=hypercopy) +

can be replaced with

f(sz, copy="se", same.as <http://same.as>= "sz0", replicate=sz.repl, fixed=FALSE , hyper=hypercopy)+
f(sz0, copy=“se0”, same.as <http://same.as>="sz", fixed=FALSE, hyper=hypercopy) +

