I am planning to use the mesh with the SPDE model for geostatistical modeling of my response variable. From my understanding, this approach is distinct from a point process model. Additionally, I have refined my method for creating the mesh to the following approach:

```
mesh <- fm_mesh_2d_inla(
  boundary = outer_boundaries,
  loc = coords_mesh,
  loc.domain = st_coordinates(outer_boundaries)[, 1:2],

  max.edge = c(20, 40),
  cutoff = 1
)

```

