this should be a straight forward extention, you just need to add two more of
these

    f(idx.na1, model = "generic", Cmatrix = matrix(1, 1, 1)) +
    f(idx.na2, model = "generic", Cmatrix = matrix(1, 1, 1))

so you get two more hyperparameters.

please print the names inside the jp.prior so you know the order of the thetas
are correct

